Dear RTW Sales and Applications Team,

I am working at INFN Laboratori Nazionali di Frascati is developing a 
laboratory fluorescence XAS instrument for measurements above 20 keV.

I would like to request a tube-only quotation for the following 
tungsten-target models:

Option 1 – reuse of our existing generator:
- RTW MCBH 80B-0.5 W;
- operation at +65 kV and up to 100 W continuous;
- compatibility with an existing Spellman uXHP65P100;
- positive HV, grounded-cathode architecture;
- maximum generator ratings: 65 kV, 5 mA setpoint, 100 W;
- filament supply: 0.3–3.5 A, 5 V maximum.

Option 2 – future 100 kV upgrade:
- RTW MCBH 100B-0.5 W;
- tungsten target;
- +100 kV, 100 W continuous;
- tube-only quotation, with the required filament and HV interface 
specified separately.

For Option 1, please provide a signed compatibility statement for the 
Spellman uXHP65P100 covering filament requirements, HV connector, cable 
resistance, filament return, preheat, emission control, conditioning and 
safe continuous-duty operating envelope.

Our tube budget ceiling is EUR 30,000. We would need a complete 
quotation by 31 July 2026, valid for at least 90 days.

Photographs of our existing tube and power supply can be provided 
immediately.

Best regards,

